      "title": "Moving a File",
      "explainer": "## Move Work with Cut and Paste\n\nYour ideas file is useful, but it now belongs inside `Notes`.\n\n- **Cut** selects an item to move.\n- **Paste** places it in a new location.\n- After a successful move, the file should no longer remain in its old location.\n\nCutting is not the same as deleting. The file and its contents are still available after you paste it."
